t creation, location validation, weather information selection, or additional weather details viewing. It also does not provide any indication of how the system would end processes when necessary. Therefore, based on the score rubric which focuses on terminological alignment, this response is not fulfilled at all and does not meet the requirements set forth in the instruction."
